    ('20205', 5, $$Then he draws the mouth of Cat.$$),
    ('20205', 6, $$The drawing is almost finished.$$),
    ('20205', 7, $$At last he draws some stripes on the body of Cat and he colours the body orange.$$),
    ('20205', 8, $$Now it is Cat's turn.$$),
    ('20205', 9, $$First Cat draws an oval.$$),
    ('20205', 10, $$Then he draws two black forms on top of the oval.$$),
    ('20205', 11, $$Now he draws the eyes and the eyebrows of dog.$$),
    ('20205', 12, $$Then he draws the mouth of Dog.$$),
    ('20205', 13, $$The drawing is almost finished.$$),
